  "question": {
    "text": "If the least and the largest real values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo></math> for which the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;has a solution, are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math> respectively; then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">4</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to_______."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>i</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p>"
